---
import Container from '@/components/ui/Container.astro';
import SectionHeading from '@/components/ui/SectionHeading.astro';
import { siteData } from '@/data/site';
---

<section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-white/50 border-y border-border/70" id="about">
  <Container>
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <SectionHeading
        kicker="Background"
        title="Engineering for feel and performance"
        id="about-heading"
      />

      <div class="reveal space-y-6 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-700 leading-relaxed font-normal" style="--delay: 150ms;">
        <p>
          I am a mobile engineer specializing in React Native, Expo, and native platform bridges. My focus is on writing deterministic, buttery-smooth client applications that maintain 60 FPS even under heavy list virtualization and complex gesture interactions.
        </p>

        <p>
          Rather than relying solely on out-of-the-box abstractions, I dig into native iOS and Android profiling tools (Instruments, Android Studio Profiler, and React DevTools) to eliminate unnecessary re-renders, optimize bridge serialization, and keep memory footprints lean.
        </p>

        <p>
          I graduated in Computer Science in 2026 and have taken apps from initial architectural design through store approval on both Google Play and Apple App Store. I value clear communication, comprehensive pull requests, and predictable release pipelines.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Focus values */}
      <div class="reveal grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-border/70" style="--delay: 250ms;">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-text mb-1">Architecture</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed">
            Clean module boundaries, offline-first state synchronizers, and strongly-typed APIs.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-text mb-1">Fluid Motion</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed">
            Declarative gesture pipelines utilizing Reanimated 3 running on UI worklets.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-text mb-1">Reliability</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed">
            Automated CI/CD with EAS Build, Fastlane, and end-to-end Maestro testing.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>
